  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">지난 여름방학 과제로 전교생에게<br>웹툰 기후위기인간 읽고 소감을 자유롭게 표현하라고 했어요.<br>결과물은 A4사이즈일것, 우수작은 과학부 게시판에 전시해준다고 했고요.<br>숙제있다고 투덜대면서도 대부분이 과제 열심히 해왔더라고요.<br> <br>어제 드디어 전시완료했어요.<br>전시 작품은 이거 두배인데 사진을 다 못찍었네요.<br> <br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9056ff97d493e656942abdca19bddfe07541f82e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9056ff97d493e656942abdca19bddfe07541f82e\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2bed234b53aac7b5d21c51be3081c821bec144e3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2bed234b53aac7b5d21c51be3081c821bec144e3\" data-origin-width=\"4032\" data-origin-height=\"3024\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/971ffa1da375d4b9b4ccb6cb06d83f3bb5a0571f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/971ffa1da375d4b9b4ccb6cb06d83f3bb5a0571f\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4b5d9da3168ceea191fab77ccd88660d6141be0\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4b5d9da3168ceea191fab77ccd88660d6141be0\" data-origin-width=\"3024\" data-origin-height=\"4032\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c51395e30abe438e90328832678a5740